As I was expecting, healer is one of the most challenging roles for
zen. However, starting potions, spells and gear proved to be major
assets. !o[E]H help both to survive immediate dangers and increase
maxHP; spells (even StF) reduce reliance on prayer; stethoscope is
just one of the best starting items for zen games.
Next I think I'll try elven ranger. I expect it to be quite
challenging, but starting Sting and MC3 have got to help.

